<p>MLA 的 KV Cache(<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>576</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">576l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord">576</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0197em;">l</span></span></span></span>)介于 MQA(<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">256l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord">256</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0197em;">l</span></span></span></span>)和 GQA(<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>1024</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1024l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord">1024</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0197em;">l</span></span></span></span>)之间, 但质量损失远小于 MQA, 与 MHA 几乎持平.</p>
